---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import LegalPage from "../../components/LegalPage.astro";
import { pageTitle } from "../../lib/seo";
---

<BaseLayout title={pageTitle("privacy")} description="privacy policy — osvant.">
  <LegalPage title="privacy">
    <h2>what we collect</h2>
    <p>
      nothing. this site loads no analytics, no tag manager, no consent banner
      and no third-party scripts of any kind. there is no account system and no
      server to send anything to.
    </p>

    <h2>what stays on your device</h2>
    <p>
      the cart is written to your browser's local storage so it survives a
      refresh, and a single session flag records that you have already seen the
      loader. both live only in your browser, are never transmitted, and clear
      when you clear site data.
    </p>

    <h2>forms</h2>
    <p>
      the newsletter, notify and contact forms validate and show their success
      and error states locally. nothing is sent and no address is stored
      anywhere.
    </p>

    <h2>hosting</h2>
    <p>
      pages are static files behind a cdn. standard request logs may exist at
      the infrastructure layer, as they do for any website, and are not used to
      build a profile of you.
    </p>
  </LegalPage>
</BaseLayout>
